 taking a  look at some other tv spots that have  come out now it does seem to be that  this person right here who we all  thought was superior iron man is indeed  the maria rambo variant of captain  marvel sadly not tony stark and again  there is just so much room for tony  stark to appear in multiverse of madness  that it is a possibility and today we  have a report that states that tom  cruise is probably entering the mcu at  some point not necessarily in multiverse  of madness but entering the mcu at some  point which is something that we've been  hearing for a while this report comes  with other news about doctor strange and  the multiverse of madness all coming  from grace randolph now i know some  people question grace but she does have  reliable sources in fact she tweeted on  january 14th that doctor strange in the  multiverse of madness is going to be  approximately two hours long without the  credits and recently it was announced  that yes doctor strange 2 is going to be  right at the 2 hour mark but it is worth  noting that in this tweet she also said  that tom cruise is not in the movie and  some other surprise cameo got cut as  well but a couple of days ago she  replied to her own tweet stating as i  said before tom cruise might have been  held back i'm 99 sure he's coming to the  mcu she even pointed out the fact that  yes while he's been filming mission  impossible this whole entire time he did  take a mysterious break to go to atlanta  a few months ago most likely to film  something at marvel studios in atlanta  now there have been a lot of supposed  leaks of tom cruise filming things for  marvel studios we don't know what is  real and what is fake if any of it is  real but considering the fact that  marvel studios wanted tom cruise to be  really the first character of the marvel  cinematic universe iron man it would  make sense that they would still want  him in the mcu and want him to play  maybe a variant of tony stark or a new  character entirely marvel studios wanted  him to play tony stark unfortunately but  also fortunately it didn't work out and  robert downey jr became the perfect iron  man however in a movie where variants  are going to be a big part of the film  it would make perfect sense for tom to  appear as a variant of iron man because  in our multiverse there exists a  universe where tom cruise actually did  get the role of iron man and he was the  main iron man of the mcu so it would be  really cool to see him cameo now  professor xavier is confirmed to be a  part of the illuminati we've heard his  voice in the trailer we know it's him  plus patrick stewart already came out  and said yep that's me so we know he's  going to be in the film but a lot of  people are worried that we're gonna have  to watch him die yet again on screen  some reports came out way before we even  got the first teaser trailer for this  film stating that wanda was actually  going to fight the illuminati and many  people if not all would die and rumors  of a scene started to go around of  professor x trying to stop wanda much  like he tried to stop jean grey in x-men  the last stand unfortunately the rumored  outcome of that battle was wanda killing  professor x now a ton has happened to  this movie since they shot the original  cut it has definitely been changed and  these rumors go back so far that they  might not even be on the table anymore  however we do know that wanda slash the  scarlet witch is indeed going to fight  the illuminati however this scene might  not play out the way we think it will is  she going to kill some members of the  illuminati and possibly some other  variants in other different universes oh  yeah i'm definitely thinking that the  kill count is going to be pretty high  for wanda she's a mother trying to save  her kids plus she's probably going to be  a little bit possessed by the dark hold  and maybe c'thun is behind it as well  combine that with her being the most  powerful being in the universe and  probably multiverse yeah she's gonna be  killing some people plus this film is  also kind of supposed to be a horror  film so there's that as well so in the  trailer we see wanda fighting captain  marvel maria rambo variant of her and  the surroundings getting pretty  shattered and we know that this is  indeed the illuminati's headquarters  because in the trailer when the ultron  bots are going through the courtyard  taking doctor strange to meet the  illuminati we see certain statues that  we also see in the scene where wanda is  fighting captain marvel so it's very  clear she's going to fight the  illuminati and probably kill most of  them but here's where a certain twist  might come into play there's a rumor  going around that professor x is indeed  going to try and stop her but not in a  way that you think the rumor is that  professor x is going to fight wanda but  he's going to fight her in her mind now  professor x is one of the most powerful  psychic mutants out there and on top of  that he is more in control of his powers  than most mutants are and this is  definitely something i can see him doing  because it makes sense professor x is in  a wheelchair he is not nearly as mobile  as wanda is so the best bet for him is  to indeed fight her in her mind to make  her believe that she is actually  fighting him but in reality it's really  professor x trying to take over her mind  to calm her down and stop her now i'm  almost 100 sure that this is going to be  unsuccessful and that wanda is going to  realize what is happening defeat him and  then in real life there's gonna be some  trouble for professor xavier but will he  kill her here or will he take this  opportunity while he's fighting inside  of her mind to physically leave so he  doesn't get killed i actually hope this  happens i know some people might not  want this to happen because they want  the fight to be real but i know the  fight between her and the other members  of the illuminati and other variants as  well are going to be 100 real so we'll  get plenty of action on that front i  just don't want to see professor x die  again but heck maybe we'll see tom  cruise's iron man die in the scene as  well now i am starting to doubt that tom  cruise is going to be in multiverse  abandons because a few different  insiders at this point have said they  don't think tom cruise is in the movie  now you never really know what's going  to happen in a movie like this but i  would keep expectations for tom cruise's  iron man pretty low there may be a  different iron man in the film again it  makes sense considering the ultron bots  but it might not be tom cruise's iron  man however it does look like tom cruise  is at one point going to be joining the  mcu whether that's as a variant of tony  stark or perhaps a new character it is  clear that the multiverse is going to be  a huge part of the mcu moving forward  and will definitely be exploring it in  other projects such as loki season 2  perhaps ant-man and the wasp quantomania  where they introduced kang but would you  want tom cruise to play a tony stark  variant or would you like him to play a  completely different and new character  in the mcu let me know your thoughts in  the comments down below don't forget to  like the video and subscribe so you  don't miss out on any of the latest  marvel news for live updates you can  follow me on instagram and twitter and  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof  [Music]

